<title>UK: First Austria Bank ups 10-year bond to 200 mln Dem.</title>
<headline>First Austria Bank ups 10-year bond to 200 mln Dem.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated bond has been increased to 200 million marks from 150 million marks, lead manager Merrill Lynch said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FIRST AUSTRIA BANK</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON     6.0 PCT   MATURITY    14.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.67    PAY DATE    14.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    99.57     SPREAD	+55 BP</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  A2/=	LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K)  1-10</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.40	SELL CONC  1.6	 LIST FEE    0.50</p>
<p> NOTES	ORIGINAL 150 MLN DEM LAUNCHED 13.FEB AT 101.39</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
